  "ingredients": [
    "4 pork chops",
    "salt and freshly ground black pepper to taste",
    "1 tablespoon oil, or as needed",
    "1 (20 ounce) can sauerkraut, drained",
    "1 apple - peeled, cored, and diced",
    "1 onion, finely chopped",
    "0.25 cup brown sugar",
    "0.5 tablespoon caraway seeds"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 2-quart casserole dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hfFWQhOC-QW-xX3KnV9dXpIuEgs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/268127-baked-pork-chops-with-sauerkraut-VAT-step-01-3f7add19e2104ebeb0d08c9c089055c8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/268127/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rub pork chops with salt and pepper on both sides. Heat oil in a skillet over medium-high heat and pan-fry pork chops on both sides until browned, 5 to 7 minutes per side.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-GcCCLO5HR5qA-TGp6kXT6LTBHE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/268127-baked-pork-chops-with-sauerkraut-VAT-step-02-74476c02b20c4c4585e8c04d7ffcce3f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/268127/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place browned pork chops into the prepared casserole dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/okudEj6LISkdPEm2YpeW7ZwHsP0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/268127-baked-pork-chops-with-sauerkraut-VAT-step-03-2c4f28ba2775455e837c8b94a6bca474.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/268127/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine sauerkraut, apple, onion, brown sugar, and caraway seeds in a bowl; cover pork chops with the mixture. Cover tightly with aluminum foil to retain moisture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YPBrVq1W9BCcF8uBEjo7VlRlvJU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/268127-baked-pork-chops-with-sauerkraut-VAT-step-04-c1fa7a30092f4609af5d9fceef7ae169.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/268127/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake pork chops in the preheated oven until no longer pink in the center, about 45 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read 145 degrees F (63 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mkqwP0cO8Toef1S6WlXZ0Y-qg5U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/268127-baked-pork-chops-with-sauerkraut-VAT-step-05-a1f61321fb25496eaaf4b6ac811ee592.jpg"
